# 2. Anatomy of a Decision Tree

Consider:

```text
                 [Age > 30?]
                  /        \
                Yes         No
                /             \
       [Income > 50K?]      Don't Buy
          /        \
        Yes         No
        /            \
      Buy          Don't Buy
```

### Important Terms

## 1️⃣ Root Node

The first decision.

```text
