```

---

## 2️⃣ Internal Node

A node that asks another question.

```text
Income > 50K?
```

---

## 3️⃣ Branch

The path resulting from a decision.

```text
Yes / No
```

---

## 4️⃣ Leaf Node

The final prediction.

```text
Buy
Don't Buy
```

